  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 404.05 Standards for the Selection of Sanctions. The board shall select appropriate sanction(s) using the standards specified in Plc 311.11.\n\nSource. #10687, eff 10-7-14; ss by #14338, eff 10-7-25, EXPIRES: 10-7-35",
